<div style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;c=
olor:#000">
<p>Hi Ben,</p>
<p>Please see attached shop drawings for Apt 109 Netanya (Milross A109) for a=
pproval: Bed 1 Robe + Study, Lounge TV Unit, Bathroom Vanity and Kitchenette.=
</p>
<p><b>** Please make sure all finishes stated on the drawings are correct **<=
/b></p>
<p>Below is what we still need answers on, by room:</p>
<p><b>All rooms</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Stone benchtops (study desk with waterfall end, TV unit, vanity, kitchene=
tte) are drawn as 20mm stone - please confirm the stone product and colour.</=
li>
</ul>
<p><b>Bed 1 Robe + Study</b></p>
<ul>
<li>TV over the robe - we have allowed for a 42" TV mounted on the fixed pane=
ls above the doors. Please confirm the TV model / size and bracket.</li>
<li>Sliding door head beam - please confirm how far the beam comes into the r=
oom (drawn at 2700).</li>
<li>Study - the 45 degree wall beside the desk was not measured (drawn at 100=
0). The stone waterfall end runs parallel to that wall.</li>
</ul>
<p><b>Lounge TV Unit</b></p>
<ul>
<li>LED uplight in the floating TV ledge - is this required? If so, please co=
nfirm the LED type / channel and where the driver will go.</li>
</ul>
<p><b>Bathroom Vanity</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Basin - white semi-recessed basin 530 x 360. Please send the manufacturer=
's cut-out template so the stone can be cut to suit.</li>
<li>LED under the vanity - please confirm the LED detail.</li>
<li>Tiled plinth (by builder) - drawn 200 high x 495 deep. Please confirm the=
 depth and how it finishes against the 45 degree wall.</li>
<li>Waste position - please confirm so we can allow the plumbing cut-out in t=
he drawers.</li>
<li>Ceiling height - drawn at 2400, please confirm.</li>
</ul>
<p><b>Kitchenette</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Sink + tap - we have drawn an Abi single bowl 380 undermount sink with an=
 Abi pull-out sink mixer (the plans showed a 400 x 460 undermount). Please co=
nfirm the sink and tap being supplied.</li>
<li>Fridge - drawn as a Smeg 600 wide x 1530 high (from the fridge picture su=
pplied, not the Samsung on the appliance invoice). The microwave box has been=
 raised to 1550 to clear it. Please confirm the fridge model.</li>
<li>AC grille in the bulkhead above the fridge - please confirm the grille si=
ze and position.</li>
<li>Integrated dishwasher (Miele G5481SCVi) - please confirm, we will size th=
e door panel to the installation template.</li>
</ul>
<p>Let me know if I've missed anything.</p>
<p>Thanks,</p>
